+From 2187c0865ab2184a5fcd37ba94e19b8c6f11f0a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Elara <elara@portal.local>
+Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:22:11 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH] ui: colour the delay, and call -1 what it is
+MIME-Version: 1.0
+Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
+Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
+
+Delays are tinted on a three-step scale (fast / tolerable / bad) and -1 is labelled
+'таймаут' in red instead of posing as a millisecond value. Sorting pushes timeouts to
+the end, where they belong.
+---
